-- 11 MutualConfluence — a CYCLIC confluence: `a` meets `b`, `b` meets `a` — the dep-DAG has a 2-cycle,
-- which no topological order resolves. Stresses: cycle handling in the foreign-dependency ordering (the
-- current classifier reads each as a `meet` independently; a real emitter must detect the cycle).
analysis MutualConfluence {
  prophecy A a : Exprs[Expr] { predict : ∀ n→n'. a(n) ⊆ b(n')  within : ∀ n. a(n) ⊆ allExprs }
  prophecy B b : Exprs[Expr] { predict : ∀ n→n'. b(n) ⊆ a(n')  within : ∀ n. b(n) ⊆ allExprs }
}
